Proposal — Office supply consolidation

Prepared for: General Affairs
Date: 8 August 2026

1. Why
Three departments order the same items separately. The August ledger shows
the same A4 paper bought at three prices in one week.

2. What we propose
One monthly order window. One vendor list. One approval line.

3. What it saves
Roughly four hours of clerical work a month, and the price spread closes.

4. What to decide
Whether the window is the first or the last week of the month.













































































































































































































































































































































































